### 1. What Is Java☕?

⁑Java is a popular,high-level,object-oriented programming language designed to build secure,robust and scalable applications.
⁑It follows the "Write Once,Run Anywhere" (WORA) method.It means that once you write java code,it can run on any platform or operating system (Windows,macOS,Linux) without any modifications.With the help of Java Virtual Machine (JVM).

